<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  -----			 O/N = -----</p>
<p>	    T/N =  5.11%			 T/N = -----</p>
<p>		   Nov 11, 1996			Nov 8, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  3.11%	1 month forward =  3.06%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  4.30%	2 month forward =  4.26%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  5.26%	3 month forward =  5.22%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.00%	4 month forward =  5.96%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.52%	5 month forward =  6.47%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.54%	6 month forward =  6.49%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
